Package: zed
Version: @PACKAGE_VERSION@
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Homepage: https://zed.dev/
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: git, mesa-vulkan-drivers | vulkan-icd, xdg-desktop-portal, xdg-desktop-portal-backend
X-Build-Inputs-SHA256: @BUILD_INPUTS_SHA256@
X-Publisher-Stream: @PUBLISHER_STREAM@
Description: Zed text editor (official binaries, Debian system libraries)
 Unofficial Debian 13 repackaging of the official stable Zed binaries.
 Uses Debian shared libraries and receives editor updates through APT.
